# Use like an API
This project was created for other modders who want to create and publish their own gods for Minecraft. It will also be used by the creator for his own mod.
If you want to use it, you can, it's free, but please:
1. Specify my API like dependency in your mod description and settings, on CurseForge and Modrinth, or any other mod publishing website.
2. Be clear that it wasn't your idea, or write **CCC Studio** in the credits.

# Sanctions
This project is still on All Rights Reserved license, so if you don't respect the above rules, I can ask the publishing site to delete your mod.
Nothing will happen without warning.